@startuml local-select-tests-before
!include ../../theme.iuml
title local-select-tests — today (teamscale-dev local MCP)

skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "Developer" as Dev

box "Developer workstation" $ws_bg
    participant "Claude\n(local-select-tests skill)" as Agent
    participant "teamscale-dev MCP\n(local stdio, per user)" as DevMCP
    participant "working tree\n(local files)" as WT
end box

box "Teamscale server" $ts_bg
    participant "Teamscale\nREST API" as TS
end box

Dev -> Agent : /teamscale:local-select-tests [paths]
Agent -> Agent : teamscale-dev -h | grep fetch-impacted-tests\n(requires >= 2026.5.0-beta)

Agent -> DevMCP : tool pre-commit(paths,\nuploadScope=ONLY_UNCOMMITTED,\nonlyPreCommitFindings=true)
activate DevMCP
DevMCP -> WT : read uncommitted edits
WT --> DevMCP : local diff
DevMCP -> TS : upload local diff + run pre-commit analysis
activate TS
TS --> DevMCP : pre-commit branch analysed
deactivate TS
DevMCP --> Agent : pre-commit findings
deactivate DevMCP

Agent -> DevMCP : tool fetch-impacted-tests(path,\nonPreCommitBranch=true, strategy=COVERAGE)
activate DevMCP
DevMCP -> TS : change-based test selection\non the pre-commit branch
activate TS
TS --> DevMCP : impacted tests (impact-ordered)
deactivate TS
DevMCP --> Agent : impacted tests
deactivate DevMCP

Agent --> Dev : report impacted tests (impact order);\ndoes not run them unless asked

note over DevMCP, WT
  NOT ts_agent_helper. Both steps depend on uploading
  the local working tree — a per-workstation operation.
end note

@enduml
